# Training artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# logs/ is ~4GB of model checkpoints + tensorboard data. Too large for git.
# Recreate by re-running train_amp.py. See SESSION_LOG.md for which checkpoint
# corresponds to which run.
logs/

# Isaac Lab writes transient outputs here (play videos, eval dumps).
outputs/
/outputs_*

